### Watermarks-Remover Capabilities

  @tool.watermarks.remove-layer-a
    description: Strip Unicode/invisible characters, exotic spaces from text/files
    code_path: service/scripts/clean_text.py, inspect_file.py
    risk: LOW — deterministic, local-only
    sdd_capability: code.write (EXISTS) for file output

  @tool.watermarks.remove-metadata
    description: Strip C2PA/EXIF/XMP/props from images, PDFs, documents
